type: software
title: "Hypermandala: interactive 2D, 3D and 4D geometry explorer"
authors:
  - family-names: Marcolongo
    given-names: Mario
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2846-7115"
abstract: >-
  Hypermandala is an experimental interactive visualization of mandalas, yantras and architecture-inspired geometric forms. It supports dimensional transitions, six-plane four-dimensional rotations, projections and cross-sections. Spatial hyperprism constructions are distinguished from explicitly labelled parameter embeddings. The project is a visualization tool, not evidence for historical or scientific claims about the depicted forms.
license: AGPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mariomarcolongo/hypermandala"
url: "https://hypermandala.mariomarcolongo.com/"
keywords:
  - geometry
  - visualization
  - four-dimensional geometry
  - interactive software
